[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=7 format=3]

; The game's UI skin. Structure follows the pattern used in the Palusteria Nights repo — a
; Theme resource over a handful of StyleBox sub-resources — but every box here is a flat fill,
; not a nine-patch texture: it costs no imported art, and a dark parchment-edged panel over the
; 3D valley matches the look the site status card already established. Colours are the project
; palette (data/palette.json): parchment text, limestone edges, habit-black panels and buttons.
;
; No display font is set yet — the engine default carries it. A serif or blackletter face is an
; art-pass decision (and a licensing one), noted in STATUS.md.

[sub_resource type="StyleBoxFlat" id="panel"]
